note.p:
The persons named in this paragraph are, in the order mentioned: Charles, Sawyer,
                    Secretary of Commerce; Edward H. Foley, Jr., Under Secretary of the Treasury;
                    Oscar L. Chapman, Secretary of the Interior; W. Averell Harriman, Special
                    Assistant to the President; John R. Steelman, The Assistant to the President;
                    Maurice J. Tobin, Secretary of Labor; and Charles F. Brannan, Secretary of
                    Agriculture.
